  "name": "B1080 - Web - Incognito Control",
  "description": "Intent: Block-tier hard enforcement on Web upload to Incognito / private-mode browsing surfaces at sensitivity floor [3,4] — shuts down exfil into anonymized destinations and flagged proxy/anonymizer URLs where downstream attribution is impossible. Exclusions: scoped by Websites_Unauthorized_Incognito_Domain_URL_[contains]; ships disabled by default — enable only after confirming the Incognito patterns list covers your environment's known anonymizers and W1090 is clean. Requirements: WIP — pending analyst testing.",
